# Mixed into the key that encrypts GitHub tokens saved in the browser (AES-256-GCM).
# Vite inlines VITE_* values into the client bundle, so this is NOT a confidential secret on its own:
# the real protection is the non-extractable per-device key in IndexedDB. Use it to rotate/invalidate
# all saved tokens by changing the value.
# Generate:  node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
VITE_VAULT_SECRET=replace-with-a-random-32-byte-value
